  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Hei Lou Lan tells Fang Yuan that the rare main material for group strength Gu has returned to market because this Gu Immortal researched and produced stone monkey fur in his blessed land after the material had been extinct for countless years. The news causes a big commotion on treasure yellow heaven.",
      "chapters": [
        679
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_hei_lou_lan",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "gu_group_strength_gu",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "loc_treasure_yellow_heaven"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan later visits that store and finds only a proud will managing it. The will prices one hundred pieces of fur at one immortal essence stone and refuses to haggle.",
      "chapters": [
        682
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "He is a rank seven Gu Immortal with a fiery, arrogant temper, strong blessed land management, and outstanding battle strength.",
      "chapters": [
        682
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "He has short white hair, a pair of golden pupils, broad shoulders, and a thin waist. He wears a tight fitting combat uniform.",
      "chapters": [
        716
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan names him a higher-up of Combat Immortal Sect among Central Continent’s ten great ancient sects, an earth path expert who also cultivates transformation path, and someone who has secretly obtained several inheritances of Reckless Savage Demon Venerable.",
      "chapters": [
        712
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "combat-immortal-sect",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_combat_immortal_sect",
        "fac_ten_great_ancient_sects",
        "char_reckless_savage_demon_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After Shi Lei became a Gu Immortal he relied on that sect and built nearly three hundred years of experience, which is why newly advanced Gu Immortals cannot match him in a straight fight.",
      "chapters": [
        733
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "combat-immortal-sect",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Inside Starry Sky grotto-heaven he appears as a white haired man with golden pupils in a tight combat uniform, and Star Lord Wan Xiang praises Immortal Monkey King for killing a desolate beast flying bear in three minutes. He is a rank seven Gu Immortal of Combat Immortal Sect.",
      "chapters": [
        716
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "praised-for-a-swift-kill",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_starry_sky_grotto_heaven",
        "char_star_lord_wan_xiang"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Central Continent already treats Immortal Monkey King Shi Lei as a Combat Immortal Sect rank seven with outstanding battle strength who has long been pushed down by Feng Jiu Ge.",
      "chapters": [
        839
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "standing-among-rank-seven",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_central_continent",
        "char_feng_jiu_ge"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At Earth Abyss he has short white hair and shining golden eyes with sharp light in them. He wears a tight martial uniform and a blue silver belt, and his forearms and knees have dazzling armor.",
      "chapters": [
        1191
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "armor-and-attire",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_earth_earth_abyss"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At a later meeting he is at the peak of rank seven, cultivating earth path primarily and transformation path secondarily, and known across Central Continent as the Immortal Monkey King. He is a supreme elder of Combat Immortal Sect, and Fairy Zi Wei assigns him to ambush Fang Yuan at Star Form blessed land, then to destroy that land when Fang Yuan does not return.",
      "chapters": [
        1191
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "heavenly-court-task",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fairy_zi_wei",
        "loc_star_form_blessed_land"
      ]
    }
  ],
